msgid "CineMosaic checks GitHub for new versions on its own and shows a notice."
msgstr "CineMosaic recherche lui-même les nouvelles versions sur GitHub et affiche un avis."

msgid "Get test versions"
msgstr "Recevoir les versions de test"

msgid "Also offers versions that are still being tested. For testers only – they can contain errors."
msgstr "Propose aussi des versions encore en test. Réservé aux testeurs – elles peuvent contenir des erreurs."

msgid "Self-test running…"
msgstr "Autotest en cours…"

msgid "Test this Mac"
msgstr "Tester ce Mac"

